    <briefdescription>
<para>Per-source rate-limit configuration. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Controls the maximum throughput for a single source connector. The token-bucket algorithm is used: tokens refill at <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_rate_limit_config_1a516c5f46f2ce7d33a28ecbc8339b8ce7" kindref="member">requests_per_second</ref></computeroutput> and each request consumes one token. When the bucket is empty the connector waits until a token is available (blocking back-pressure). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
